WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:33.650 --> 00:01:34.950
I'm bored...

00:01:39.380 --> 00:01:40.750
Kathleen.

00:01:46.930 --> 00:01:48.300
Kathlee--

00:01:48.420 --> 00:01:49.890
Ahh!

00:01:50.340 --> 00:01:52.060
What do you think you're doing?!

00:01:55.430 --> 00:01:57.240
What's going on?

00:01:57.640 --> 00:01:59.730
There's no way around it!

00:01:59.730 --> 00:02:02.670
He was spying on me in the bath!

00:02:02.900 --> 00:02:04.640
Prince Pervert!

00:02:04.820 --> 00:02:07.120
No one mocks the King's son!

00:02:07.660 --> 00:02:09.980
First of all, who'd want to see...

00:02:10.440 --> 00:02:11.680
those floppy things?

00:02:12.400 --> 00:02:14.770
You looked hard enough!

00:02:15.140 --> 00:02:16.380
J--Jabir...

00:02:16.380 --> 00:02:18.180
Your anger is entirely reasonable...

00:02:18.310 --> 00:02:19.900
please take it out on me instead!

00:02:20.420 --> 00:02:22.260
That's some impressive devotion...

00:02:22.430 --> 00:02:24.490
You were going to hit me?

00:02:25.190 --> 00:02:28.240
Me, the son of the representative of the Lord Ragi?

00:02:28.240 --> 00:02:33.210
"Shape of Love"

00:02:35.540 --> 00:02:36.800
Unfathomable...

00:02:36.860 --> 00:02:40.640
Westerners' thinking is completely beyond me!

00:02:41.430 --> 00:02:42.750
I'm sorry...

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:44.740
I didn't mean it...

00:02:44.970 --> 00:02:47.010
Even this is good experience.

00:02:49.510 --> 00:02:51.500
Some shady-looking guys just showed up...

00:02:54.750 --> 00:02:55.850
Out for blood...

00:02:57.070 --> 00:02:58.600
Your Highness, assassins!

00:02:59.210 --> 00:03:02.040
Please escape while I hold them back!

00:03:02.140 --> 00:03:05.040
Don't be ridiculous! We'll all escape out the window!

00:03:05.040 --> 00:03:07.990
Delivery for Mr. Burnsworth.

00:03:08.190 --> 00:03:09.580
C--coming!

00:03:09.810 --> 00:03:11.110
No choice...

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:13.960
Jabir, defend this place to the end.

00:03:14.150 --> 00:03:17.140
I grant you permission to give your life for God and the royal family!

00:03:17.390 --> 00:03:18.980
Oh! Your Highness!

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:21.470
You would give me that honor?

00:03:21.880 --> 00:03:23.650
W--what are you talking about?

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:24.760
Quickly, Your Highness!

00:03:24.790 --> 00:03:26.330
Farewell, Jabir.

00:03:27.370 --> 00:03:29.130
Come, Kathleen!

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:30.600
Just a minute!

00:03:36.330 --> 00:03:37.990
It's His Highness!

00:03:53.100 --> 00:03:54.440
This way!

00:03:57.820 --> 00:03:59.670
That was a quick getaway...

00:03:59.740 --> 00:04:03.070
If we fail this time, there's no way we can face Master Nasanal.

00:04:04.000 --> 00:04:06.390
It was a mistake to rely on the Mafia!

00:04:06.480 --> 00:04:09.190
So you hired white men to kill the King?!

00:04:09.920 --> 00:04:12.570
You sold out the very soul of Raginei?!

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:15.800
You are fools...

00:04:15.910 --> 00:04:17.480
Your Highness...

00:04:17.590 --> 00:04:19.110
Tell Master Nasanal...

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:23.180
Why would anyone born in Raginei kill the King?

00:04:23.960 --> 00:04:26.510
If the King is killed... it's also the end of Raginei!

00:04:27.540 --> 00:04:31.300
He would see us reduced to Britain's subordinates, a vassal state!

00:04:32.090 --> 00:04:34.000
If he can't see the larger picture...

00:04:34.170 --> 00:04:35.920
how can he call himself a leader?

00:04:37.190 --> 00:04:38.620
<i>That's the voice of a King...</i>

00:04:39.180 --> 00:04:41.280
He's a heedless fool, this Master Nasanal.

00:04:41.730 --> 00:04:42.960
Your Highness...

00:04:44.710 --> 00:04:47.380
<i>He makes people come to his service so easily...</i>

00:04:48.780 --> 00:04:51.750
<i>You... were truly born to be a King...</i>

00:04:53.340 --> 00:04:54.940
Come, if you're coming!

00:04:55.010 --> 00:04:57.000
I am already dead!

00:05:01.780 --> 00:05:03.300
General Hassan!

00:05:03.480 --> 00:05:06.970
You were going to use a sword to fight men with guns?

00:05:08.320 --> 00:05:10.510
Good thing reinforcements got here in time.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.470
Where is His Highness?

00:05:12.670 --> 00:05:14.240
About that...

00:05:14.970 --> 00:05:17.640
At any rate, we have to go to the police quick.

00:05:17.920 --> 00:05:19.400
I'm worried about Jabir.

00:05:19.840 --> 00:05:21.860
I granted Jabir permission to die.

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:23.950
He probably died with pride.

00:05:24.840 --> 00:05:26.520
You can't be serious?

00:05:26.650 --> 00:05:28.480
The King grants someone death...

00:05:28.860 --> 00:05:30.990
only when the fate of the nation depends on it.

00:05:31.630 --> 00:05:33.510
The House of Jabir...

00:05:33.510 --> 00:05:36.020
will be remembered forever for this.

00:05:36.470 --> 00:05:38.000
I don't believe you!

00:05:38.290 --> 00:05:41.060
You're not fit to be King!

00:05:41.850 --> 00:05:44.270
I may not know how things are in your country...

00:05:44.950 --> 00:05:46.470
but as a person...

00:05:46.670 --> 00:05:49.660
if someone can lay down his life for your sake...

00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:51.660
and you won't even care when he dies...

00:05:52.030 --> 00:05:54.340
then you're the kind of person I despise!

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.440
Without all your attendants, you're completely helpless...

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.500
so drop the big act!

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:03.070
You're a little baby who doesn't know anything!

00:06:05.790 --> 00:06:07.360
Now you've done it!

00:06:09.500 --> 00:06:10.800
How could you...

00:06:10.840 --> 00:06:13.070
you made me break my promise to my mother...

00:06:14.280 --> 00:06:16.140
On her deathbed, my mother told me...

00:06:16.350 --> 00:06:18.730
that women were frail, that I must protect them...

00:06:19.230 --> 00:06:22.180
and I must never raise a hand against one.

00:06:23.040 --> 00:06:25.330
And I promised, but now...

00:06:26.160 --> 00:06:28.740
<i>He feels no shame...</i>

00:06:29.060 --> 00:06:32.850
<i>a moment ago he forced grown men to his will...</i>

00:06:33.590 --> 00:06:36.670
<i>and now he's crying like a child of five or six.</i>

00:06:37.570 --> 00:06:39.170
<i>It's overpowering...</i>

00:06:39.290 --> 00:06:41.740
<i>this extraordinary gentility...</i>

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.480
<i>Beautiful...</i>

00:06:46.770 --> 00:06:48.560
<i>they look just like pearls...</i>

00:06:57.000 --> 00:06:58.510
I'm sorry.

00:06:58.860 --> 00:07:00.230
Please don't cry.

00:07:03.210 --> 00:07:06.170
Say, how old were you when you lost your mother?

00:07:07.250 --> 00:07:08.930
Eight.

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:11.110
I was 13 when it happened.

00:07:11.460 --> 00:07:14.330
Right after we came to New York from Oklahoma...

00:07:14.750 --> 00:07:16.490
we both got sick.

00:07:17.580 --> 00:07:20.380
She lost her job, and we had nothing to eat...

00:07:20.730 --> 00:07:23.310
so nothing helped.

00:07:23.310 --> 00:07:27.640
We had to learn the true meaning of hunger...

00:07:28.250 --> 00:07:31.240
I was lucky, so I managed to survive...

00:07:32.040 --> 00:07:34.840
I guess when you think about it, being King means...

00:07:34.900 --> 00:07:38.280
making sure that doesn't happen to your country, huh?

00:07:38.850 --> 00:07:40.050
Yeah...

00:07:40.050 --> 00:07:41.420
I suppose so.

00:07:41.650 --> 00:07:44.490
Hey, when you become King...

00:07:45.290 --> 00:07:47.580
make everyone happy, okay?

00:07:48.000 --> 00:07:51.980
Make it so no one is shivering in the cold or going hungry.

00:07:54.400 --> 00:07:56.700
I never want to let anyone else...

00:07:56.870 --> 00:07:59.270
gnaw on potato skins to get by...

00:07:59.750 --> 00:08:01.050
So...

00:08:02.580 --> 00:08:04.650
make them happy.

00:08:06.020 --> 00:08:07.120
Okay.

00:08:08.260 --> 00:08:10.310
<i>My instructors in the art of being King...</i>

00:08:10.370 --> 00:08:12.780
<i>had a more complicated way of putting it.</i>

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.500
Kathleen...

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.730
Did I hurt you?

00:08:16.750 --> 00:08:18.770
Hah. Do I look that fragile?

00:08:18.940 --> 00:08:20.430
<i>But I feel like now...</i>

00:08:20.520 --> 00:08:22.970
<i>I understand for the first time...</i>

00:08:23.770 --> 00:08:26.950
C'mon, let's hide out at the club until morning.

00:08:27.270 --> 00:08:28.840
Everyone should be gone by now.

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:34.500
<i>what king... and crown... and country... really mean...</i>

00:08:37.340 --> 00:08:39.110
Oh, dear, you're soaking wet.

00:08:39.190 --> 00:08:42.340
Er, I mustn't take off your headcloth, right?

00:08:42.560 --> 00:08:45.530
Removing it in front of a woman is a declaration of love.

00:08:45.680 --> 00:08:46.940
You don't say?

00:08:46.980 --> 00:08:49.780
But... you are a Royal Handmaiden. You may.

00:08:50.340 --> 00:08:51.420
Yes, sir.

00:08:51.640 --> 00:08:54.090
No more tears, my Prince.

00:08:55.430 --> 00:08:58.230
Wait here. I'll go grab us something to eat.

00:09:08.970 --> 00:09:10.090
Well?

00:09:10.130 --> 00:09:11.090
It tastes good...

00:09:11.090 --> 00:09:12.760
I finally found something you like!

00:09:13.050 --> 00:09:16.140
When it's hot... soup is really good...

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:17.600
Huh?

00:09:17.600 --> 00:09:20.150
In the Royal Palace, they don't serve anything hot.

00:09:20.630 --> 00:09:22.160
They say it's bad for you...

00:09:22.850 --> 00:09:25.890
I never even knew about this kind of thing.

00:09:26.640 --> 00:09:28.880
Maybe it's just like you said...

00:09:29.670 --> 00:09:33.080
Maybe I really don't know anything...

00:09:35.250 --> 00:09:36.620
Kathleen...

00:09:36.780 --> 00:09:38.690
I used to hate white people.

00:09:39.330 --> 00:09:42.990
But did I really even know what "white people" were?

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:47.290
The first white woman I ever saw up close was you.

00:09:48.210 --> 00:09:50.320
I was shocked by how different you were.

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:53.310
To be honest, it gave me the creeps.

00:09:53.720 --> 00:09:55.190
Well, excuse me...

00:09:55.630 --> 00:09:56.750
But now...

00:09:57.130 --> 00:10:01.200
you seem more beautiful than even my mother's memory...

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:05.470
Kathleen...

00:10:06.050 --> 00:10:09.070
I wonder if Jabir got to know warmth...

00:10:09.750 --> 00:10:11.980
If he died without knowing it, that would be a pity...

00:10:12.960 --> 00:10:15.960
Even if he died with honor... it would be a pity.

00:10:18.250 --> 00:10:19.800
Being ignorant...

00:10:20.730 --> 00:10:22.140
is pitiful...

00:10:36.310 --> 00:10:37.620
<i>Kathleen...</i>

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:42.860
You really are warm...

00:10:42.860 --> 00:10:44.440
Sure I am.

00:10:45.300 --> 00:10:50.360
But when all I have is this, all to myself... it's only natural.

00:10:56.760 --> 00:10:58.170
Machaty.

00:10:59.440 --> 00:11:02.120
Get up, it's a beautiful day.

00:11:05.680 --> 00:11:07.050
No use fighting it.

00:11:07.420 --> 00:11:10.490
I put some hot coffee on. Time to wake up.

00:11:17.150 --> 00:11:19.190
But I don't want to wake up...

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.380
Is something wrong?

00:11:28.730 --> 00:11:29.800
I've been thinking.

00:11:30.210 --> 00:11:32.470
How to make the dream reality...

00:11:34.890 --> 00:11:36.200
Kathleen.

00:11:37.790 --> 00:11:39.610
Marry me.

00:11:41.460 --> 00:11:43.080
Nonsense!

00:11:43.150 --> 00:11:47.030
Your Highness was betrothed before God to Miss Arena!

00:11:47.440 --> 00:11:49.580
I'm not being self-indulgent.

00:11:49.960 --> 00:11:52.730
I will make any sacrifice for the sake of my country.

00:11:53.020 --> 00:11:56.810
But if I'm not free even to choose my own companion...

00:11:57.160 --> 00:12:00.630
I can't call myself a King. I'm not fit to become one.

00:12:01.520 --> 00:12:03.130
Your Highness...

00:12:03.590 --> 00:12:05.190
<i>He looks peaceful...</i>

00:12:05.630 --> 00:12:08.180
<i>What could have happened in one day?</i>

00:12:09.010 --> 00:12:10.830
I told him it's impossible!

00:12:10.980 --> 00:12:14.230
I'm sorry I was foolish enough to let it come to this!

00:12:14.740 --> 00:12:17.580
Well, then, please hide yourself immediately.

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:22.390
It's His Highness' disposition. He will not fail to carry out his intention.

00:12:22.870 --> 00:12:26.020
And the result will be chaos in our country...

00:12:29.460 --> 00:12:31.470
Please forget all of this...

00:12:31.910 --> 00:12:34.170
as if it were a dream.

00:12:34.780 --> 00:12:36.600
<i>Nothing happened.</i>

00:12:37.040 --> 00:12:39.350
<i>The last two days...</i>

00:12:40.240 --> 00:12:41.610
<i>were a dream.</i>

00:12:43.860 --> 00:12:47.080
<i>My Prince with the long black eyes...</i>

00:12:47.810 --> 00:12:50.360
<i>I'll never see you near me again...</i>

00:12:55.260 --> 00:12:56.600
Kathleen...

00:12:59.310 --> 00:13:00.800
I think...

00:13:00.910 --> 00:13:02.650
I loved Machaty.

00:13:03.350 --> 00:13:05.390
I fell so much in love with him.

00:13:07.530 --> 00:13:09.440
I only just realized...

00:13:11.030 --> 00:13:13.990
Why did it have to be someone so far from me?

00:13:28.900 --> 00:13:30.400
Where are we going?

00:13:30.850 --> 00:13:32.240
We made it.

00:13:33.110 --> 00:13:34.000
Look...

00:13:39.380 --> 00:13:40.850
Machaty...

00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:43.140
Go ahead and burn his image into your memory.

00:13:44.290 --> 00:13:46.290
Thank you, Fred.

00:13:51.680 --> 00:13:53.870
Kathleen!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:57.120
Machaty!

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:58.170
Spotted!

00:13:58.270 --> 00:14:00.280
--Kathleen!
--Your Highness!

00:14:04.510 --> 00:14:05.820
Kathleen!

00:14:15.500 --> 00:14:18.560
As the gods are my witnesses...

00:14:18.940 --> 00:14:20.450
I ask you...

00:14:20.610 --> 00:14:22.130
will you marry me?

00:14:23.430 --> 00:14:24.880
Machaty...

00:14:25.210 --> 00:14:26.590
someone like you...

00:14:35.060 --> 00:14:38.090
<i>Stop! Please don't kill him!</i>

00:14:40.510 --> 00:14:44.140
<i>Please don't kill my Prince!</i>

00:14:51.680 --> 00:14:52.980
Kathleen...

00:14:54.870 --> 00:14:56.500
What's your answer to my proposal?

00:14:58.120 --> 00:14:59.630
You're alive...

00:15:00.320 --> 00:15:01.600
You dummy...

00:15:11.020 --> 00:15:12.900
Your hand, Kathleen.

00:15:14.310 --> 00:15:18.290
When I was born, this ring was given to the Queen.

00:15:18.600 --> 00:15:20.420
Only one was ever made.

00:15:20.960 --> 00:15:22.590
Something so valuable...

00:15:22.800 --> 00:15:25.960
Don't give it to me. I'll just lose it.

00:15:26.920 --> 00:15:28.100
I don't care.

00:15:28.140 --> 00:15:30.520
You are my one and only queen.

00:15:31.920 --> 00:15:34.470
I'll take care of it... always.

00:15:36.190 --> 00:15:38.610
I <i>will</i> convince my father to agree.

00:15:39.180 --> 00:15:41.290
Your Highness... it's time.

00:15:46.510 --> 00:15:49.660
How was that? It's the Western way of saying goodbye.

00:15:49.980 --> 00:15:51.630
I think I'm getting used to it.

00:15:51.960 --> 00:15:53.490
Oh, Machaty...

00:15:53.840 --> 00:15:57.150
Fred... sooner or later I will come for Kathleen.

00:15:57.560 --> 00:16:00.050
Until then, I leave her in your hands, my friend.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.740
Wait for me. I'll be back soon.

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.120
Soon!

00:16:09.830 --> 00:16:11.650
Are you really alright?

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:14.670
Machaty left me many gifts...

00:16:15.110 --> 00:16:16.290
I'm content.

00:16:16.990 --> 00:16:19.380
And I will raise his child.

00:16:20.780 --> 00:16:22.050
I'm glad.

00:16:22.270 --> 00:16:25.020
To have at least that much to look forward to...

00:16:26.100 --> 00:16:29.320
If that's what you're looking forward to, I want to be part of it.

00:16:30.980 --> 00:16:33.620
Mind having me for a second father?

00:16:47.130 --> 00:16:48.490
Machaty...

00:16:48.530 --> 00:16:49.630
Fred!

00:16:53.050 --> 00:16:54.210
Kajika...

00:16:54.230 --> 00:16:57.030
You knew your heart was weak, didn't you?

00:16:57.320 --> 00:16:59.390
Why didn't you tell me!

00:17:04.200 --> 00:17:06.970
<i>Before, I'm sure he said "Machaty..."</i>

00:17:07.230 --> 00:17:10.800
<i>Why would Fred say the name of Raginei's former king?</i>

00:17:11.560 --> 00:17:13.690
<i>Come to think of it, Noei said something...</i>

00:17:14.940 --> 00:17:17.550
Kajika resembles His Highness Rumaty.

00:17:18.060 --> 00:17:21.880
By some random chance, they have exactly the same expressions...

00:17:23.630 --> 00:17:26.390
<i>Her resemblance to Rumaty...</i>

00:17:26.510 --> 00:17:28.570
<i>could Kajika be Machaty's...?</i>

00:17:29.470 --> 00:17:32.740
<i>No... however you slice it, it's too big a stretch...</i>

00:17:33.470 --> 00:17:35.270
<i>If it were true, then 54 years ago...</i>

00:17:35.550 --> 00:17:38.030
<i>Machaty would have to have been in New York.</i>

00:17:40.370 --> 00:17:43.260
Master Lee-Leng... i--it's Miss Kajika...

00:17:47.300 --> 00:17:48.890
Kajika?

00:17:48.960 --> 00:17:50.490
Fred's alright.

00:17:53.380 --> 00:17:54.590
I think I...

00:17:54.700 --> 00:17:57.140
may not be Fred's granddaughter.

00:17:58.800 --> 00:18:00.410
At any rate, let's discuss it outside.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:02.690
C'mon...

00:18:07.880 --> 00:18:09.730
For a long time I couldn't say it.

00:18:09.830 --> 00:18:13.580
But if I thought Fred was going to die...

00:18:13.680 --> 00:18:15.120
it would be unbearable.

00:18:15.900 --> 00:18:19.300
But really, this isn't fair.

00:18:19.650 --> 00:18:21.220
Kajika...

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:27.730
Now, now, gracious me.

00:18:27.730 --> 00:18:28.950
Kajika.

00:18:29.010 --> 00:18:30.450
I hate boys!

00:18:30.710 --> 00:18:32.880
They act rough, but then they start crying!

00:18:33.940 --> 00:18:36.110
I used to feel the same way.

00:18:36.590 --> 00:18:38.110
But just once...

00:18:38.310 --> 00:18:41.680
I saw a boy's tears and was deeply moved.

00:18:43.400 --> 00:18:47.540
I felt the beauty of it with my whole heart...

00:18:48.010 --> 00:18:50.590
The tears, as lovely as pearls...

00:18:50.720 --> 00:18:53.720
streamed one after another down his cheek.

00:18:54.000 --> 00:18:58.750
He didn't even wipe them away, just stood stock still in his sorrow.

00:18:59.480 --> 00:19:01.710
I was fascinated.

00:19:02.540 --> 00:19:05.180
That was when I understood.

00:19:05.950 --> 00:19:08.400
This was what they meant by "love."

00:19:08.940 --> 00:19:11.300
That boy... it was Fred?

00:19:12.670 --> 00:19:14.100
No...

00:19:18.180 --> 00:19:21.590
I had never seen such a beautiful smile.

00:19:22.830 --> 00:19:25.960
Whatever I do, the doubts from that day won't go away...

00:19:26.250 --> 00:19:27.670
but even so, I couldn't ask...

00:19:28.950 --> 00:19:30.430
It's too awful!

00:19:30.640 --> 00:19:34.510
When I loved them both so much, to think my dear Kathleen had betrayed my dear Fred...

00:19:35.110 --> 00:19:36.370
Kajika...

00:19:40.640 --> 00:19:42.860
Fred, should you be sitting up?

00:19:42.940 --> 00:19:44.160
Kajika...

00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:47.710
there's something I need to tell you.

00:19:50.260 --> 00:19:52.260
You can stay, I don't mind.

00:19:53.120 --> 00:19:56.660
It was my idea to get married.

00:19:56.960 --> 00:20:01.660
I figured the baby in Kathleen's belly needed a father.

00:20:03.860 --> 00:20:07.910
When we became husband and wife, I discovered love could come in this shape, too.

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:11.410
We loved each other in our own fashion...

00:20:11.980 --> 00:20:16.660
It was not passion, but a quiet regard we had for each other.

00:20:17.230 --> 00:20:20.650
I never had any idea it was hurting you...

00:20:23.070 --> 00:20:25.070
Forgive me.

00:20:26.900 --> 00:20:30.870
But, if I could accept Harry peacefully...

00:20:31.020 --> 00:20:34.980
perhaps it's because I, too, loved his father.

00:20:35.110 --> 00:20:36.160
Even so...

00:20:36.200 --> 00:20:39.060
my only grandfather is you, Fred!

00:20:39.980 --> 00:20:42.250
I love you, Fred.

00:20:43.550 --> 00:20:44.730
Kajika...

00:20:59.190 --> 00:21:01.800
This was my life's work...

00:21:02.580 --> 00:21:05.500
but it will never be completed.

00:21:06.580 --> 00:21:09.800
To meet with something extraordinary and true...

00:21:09.960 --> 00:21:14.070
For a writer, it's a blessing and a curse.

00:21:14.350 --> 00:21:16.460
When the truth is like this...

00:21:16.610 --> 00:21:19.930
no fiction could ever compare.

00:21:24.510 --> 00:21:27.120
Time never stops, does it...

00:21:27.330 --> 00:21:29.160
Tiny little Kajika...

00:21:29.250 --> 00:21:33.430
has grown up into someone who would cry out of sympathy for me.

00:21:34.550 --> 00:21:36.940
You remind me of Harry.

00:21:38.080 --> 00:21:40.860
You understand things you need never have understood.

00:21:41.080 --> 00:21:42.940
Poor child.

00:21:42.940 --> 00:21:45.920
You're not as strong as Harry, though.

00:21:46.450 --> 00:21:48.790
Delicate people like you...

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:51.720
aren't suited by nature for the business world.

00:21:53.020 --> 00:21:55.030
Is that so?

00:21:55.250 --> 00:21:59.430
A novelist's powers of observation are nothing to sneeze at.

00:22:00.610 --> 00:22:03.280
You are a poor child.

00:22:03.630 --> 00:22:06.010
You ought to wake up to that fact.

00:22:06.280 --> 00:22:07.930
I'll bear it in mind.

00:22:10.580 --> 00:22:12.580
Lee-Leng, give me your hand...

00:22:15.860 --> 00:22:18.730
I leave Kajika in your hands.

00:22:19.780 --> 00:22:21.790
I accept.

00:22:23.450 --> 00:22:26.060
Lee-Leng, look! I got so many fish!

00:22:26.730 --> 00:22:28.830
I'm going to let Fred eat them.

00:22:29.660 --> 00:22:32.650
Fred has agreed to have a nurse stay with him.

00:22:33.480 --> 00:22:36.500
Really? That's a big step forward.

00:22:40.010 --> 00:22:42.300
What's wrong? You seem down.

00:22:42.910 --> 00:22:46.730
Maybe a bit... I'm sure it's just the weather.

00:22:46.950 --> 00:22:48.850
Perhaps a storm is coming...

00:22:49.060 --> 00:22:51.030
Yes... perhaps.

00:22:55.680 --> 00:22:57.940
<i>It'll be here very soon.</i>

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
